- `crates/vox-compiler/src/web_ir/validate_a11y.rs`:
    - Implemented `validate_a11y_with_registry` to perform a depth-first search from each view root.
    - This function tracks the current foreground/background surface pair based on `data-vox-surface` attributes.
    - For `<p>`, `<h1>`–`<h6>` elements within a surface context, it looks up resolved hex color values from the `TokenRegistry`.
